\ Strict (interpreter-free) variant of aot_user_method.1z. The generic
\ word, the user method registration, and the predicate must all
\ AOT-compile with no interpreter fallback. User dispatch registrations
\ do not replay across the freeze->runtime boundary, so the generic
\ body's fallthrough is the observable behavior at runtime.

box: virtual{ fixnum } ;

bump: generic ( s -- n ) [ drop -1 ] ;
bump: method{ box } [ unmake-box 1 + ] ;

5 make-box bump .
9 >box bump .
5 make-box box? .
"not-a-box" box? .
